From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pi Zero Companion <pi-zero-companion@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: bcm2835-unicam: match standard Pi compatible

The Raspberry Pi device tree uses the standard bcm2835-unicam compatible,
while the upstream-style driver also needs to bind to that compatible for the
CSI platform device to probe.

Signed-off-by: Pi Zero Companion <pi-zero-companion@localhost>
---
 drivers/media/platform/broadcom/bcm2835-unicam.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/media/platform/broadcom/bcm2835-unicam.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/broadcom/bcm2835-unicam.c
@@ -2711,6 +2711,7 @@ static void unicam_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
 
 static const struct of_device_id unicam_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm2835-unicam-upstream", },
+	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm2835-unicam", },
 	{ /* sentinel */ },
 };
 MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, unicam_of_match);
--
2.39.5